            "text": "The 'use_pty' flag is not enabled globally. Without a pseudo-terminal (PTY) allocation, processes run via sudo can access the invoking terminal's input buffer, enabling terminal hijacking.\nRemediation: Add 'Defaults use_pty' globally to the sudoers file.\nExample Fix:\nDefaults use_pty"
